WHAT IS NOT HERE, AND ON PURPOSE

The client's physical data pack lives under `poc-data/`. It belongs to AGM Inc,
it is confidential under clause 9 of the agreement, and it is excluded from
version control. Nothing in this repository may copy its contents into a tracked
file.

The identity of AGM Inc is not recorded here. It is a client's data, and it
belongs in the client's own taxonomy: it is loaded into the store as the head
organisation of its entity tree, by `services/store/load_2025.py`. That
taxonomy is the one the dimension encryption will cover once decision D1 of
issue #6 is settled, which is why the identity is placed there rather than in a
file that would never be encrypted.
